[00:06.23] Written by S. Hamblen
[00:06.57] This old house once knew its children
[00:08.97] This old house once knew its wife
[00:11.25] This old house was home and comfort
[00:13.66] As they fought the storms of life
[00:15.96] This old house once rang with laughter
[00:18.35] This old house heard many shouts
[00:20.66] Now it trembles in the darkness
[00:22.92] When the lightning walks about
[00:25.49] Ain't gonna need this house no longer
[00:27.93] Ain't gonna need this house no more
[00:29.95] Ain't got time to fix the shingles
[00:32.44] Ain't got time to fix the floor
[00:34.48] Ain't got time to oil the hinges
[00:37.04] Nor to mend the window pain
[00:39.42] Ain't gonna need this house no longer
[00:41.84] He's getting ready to meet the saints
